{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 22,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Israel’s Suffering in Egypt"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the names of the children of Israel who came to Egypt; each man and his household came with Jacob: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Reuben, Simeon, Levi, and Judah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Issachar, Zebulun, and Benjamin; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Dan, Naphtali, Gad, and Asher. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. who came from the loins of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who were descendants of Jacob were seventy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "DSS, LXX seventy-five; cf. Acts 7:14"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " persons (for Joseph was in Egypt "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "already"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Joseph died, all his brothers, and all that generation. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the children of Israel were fruitful and increased abundantly, multiplied and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "became very numerous"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "grew exceedingly mighty; and the land was filled with them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there arose a new king over Egypt, who did not know Joseph. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to his people, “Look, the people of the children of Israel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " more and mightier than we; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "come, let us deal shrewdly with them, lest they multiply, and it happen, in the event of war, that they also join our enemies and fight against us, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "so"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " go up out of the land.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore they set taskmasters over them to afflict them with their burdens. And they built for Pharaoh supply cities, Pithom and Raamses. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the more they afflicted them, the more they multiplied and grew. And they were in dread of the children of Israel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the Egyptians made the children of Israel serve with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "harshness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rigor. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they made their lives bitter with hard bondage—in mortar, in brick, and in all manner of service in the field. All their service in which they made them serve "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with rigor."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the king of Egypt spoke to the Hebrew midwives, of whom the name of one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Shiphrah and the name of the other Puah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and he said, “When you do the duties of a midwife for the Hebrew women, and see "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the birthstools, if it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a son, then you shall kill him; but if it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a daughter, then she shall live.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the midwives feared God, and did not do as the king of Egypt commanded them, but saved the male children alive. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the king of Egypt called for the midwives and said to them, “Why have you done this thing, and saved the male children alive?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the midwives said to Pharaoh, “Because the Hebrew women "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not like the Egyptian women; for they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "have vigor of life, bear quickly, easily"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " lively and give birth before the midwives come to them.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore God dealt well with the midwives, and the people multiplied and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "became very numerous"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "grew very mighty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And so it was, because the midwives feared God, that He "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "gave them families"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "provided households for them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Pharaoh commanded all his people, saying, “Every son who is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Sam., LXX, Tg. add to the Hebrews"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "born you shall cast into the river, and every daughter you shall save alive.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}